    "answer": "The rares cost 19*1=$<<19=19>>19\nThe uncommon cards cost 11*.5=$<<11*.5=5.5>>5.5\nThe commons cost 30*.25=$<<30*.25=7.5>>7.5\nSo the total cost 19+5.5+7.5=$<<19+5.5+7.5=32>>32\n#### 32"
